# [CDNI](../wg/cdni.html)

## Summary

The Content Delivery Network Interconnection (CDNI) Working Group met at IETF 127. The agenda was reordered to accommodate participant availability. Key discussions focused on draft updates for delivery metadata, control interface triggers, protected secrets metadata, and operational updates regarding metadata expression language and logging extensions. The working group also discussed milestone target dates, operational considerations across specifications, and moving WG draft management to an official IETF GitHub repository.

